  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the tagine pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced speck and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped carrots and potatoes, and cook for 5 minutes, until they start to soften.",
    "Add the tomato paste, cumin, and paprika, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the vegetable broth, and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover the tagine pot, and simmer for 30 minutes, until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste, and serve hot."
